WEBVTT

00:04:59.462 --> 00:05:01.630
they earn each week at local markets.

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:05.968
In a region where 20 percent of women
own a bank account,

00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:08.596
60 percent of myAgro farmers are women.

00:05:10.514 --> 00:05:15.061
In 2021, the average myAgro farmer
grew two times more food

00:05:15.061 --> 00:05:17.813
than non-myAgro farmers in the same area.

00:05:18.356 --> 00:05:21.650
This translates to 200 dollars
of additional net income.

00:05:23.027 --> 00:05:25.905
For context, for a farmer
living on 1.50 per day,

00:05:25.946 --> 00:05:27.865
that's a 35 percent increase.

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:33.120
And by expanding the purchasing power
for smallholder farmers,